  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer MMM and for an array AAA of length NNN, define\n\n\nS(i,j)=Ai+Ai+1+…+AjS(i, j) = A_i + A_{i + 1} + \\ldots + A_jS(i,j)=Ai​+Ai+1​+…+Aj​ for 1≤i≤j≤N1 \\le i \\le j \\le N1≤i≤j≤N.\nT(i,j)=min⁡(S(i,j) mod M,(M−S(i,j)) mod M)T(i, j) = \\min(S(i, j) \\bmod M, (M - S(i, j)) \\bmod M)T(i,j)=min(S(i,j)modM,(M−S(i,j))modM)\nf(A,M)=min⁡1≤i≤j≤N(T(i,j))f(A, M) = \\displaystyle\\min_{1 \\le i \\le j \\le N}(T(i, j))f(A,M)=1≤i≤j≤Nmin​(T(i,j))\nFor each N=1,2,…,MN = 1, 2, \\ldots, MN=1,2,…,M, find the sum of f(A,M)f(A, M)f(A,M) over all MNM^NMN arrays satisfying\n\n\n0≤Ai&lt;M0 \\le A_i &lt; M0≤Ai​&lt;M\n∣A∣=N|A| = N∣A∣=N\nSince the answers may be large, print them modulo 998244353998244353998244353.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nThe first and only line of input contains a single integer MMM.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print MMM integers, the sum of f(A,M)f(A, M)f(A,M) over arrays of size NNN for each N=1,2,…,MN = 1, 2, \\ldots, MN=1,2,…,M, modulo 998244353998244353998244353.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\le T \\le 1001≤T≤100",
      "1≤M≤2⋅1051 \\le M \\le 2 \\cdot 10^51≤M≤2⋅105",
      "The sum of MMM over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105."
    ],
